  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Take A Look GUNS Remastered</h1>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Take A Look GUNS Remastered</strong> 是原版 Take A Look GUNS 整合包的全新重制版。</p>\n<p>本作建立在 Take A Look 系列的基础之上，从底层进行了重新设计，旨在提供更沉浸式的体验，重点聚焦于<strong>现代枪械、战争、工程与探索</strong>。</p>\n<p>原版整合包以末日背景下的枪械和僵尸为特色。而在这个重制版中，我们移除了僵尸元素，从而更加专注于军事战斗、先进武器、载具以及大规模战役。</p>\n<p>无论是单人游玩还是与好友联机，Take A Look GUNS Remastered 都提供了无数的机会供你建造、自动化生产、探索并主宰战场。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050140/description_b4bb23f6-688f-407c-9380-f6cfed80412f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"394\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\">特色功能</h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>武器与战争</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classics Zero (TACZ)</a></strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superb-warfare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SuperB Warfare</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></strong></li>\n<li>额外的武器包及军事主题内容</li>\n<li>扩展的战斗机制与装备系统</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050140/description_aab5d257-e02a-4295-a8e5-f4eca4b858bc.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"227\" height=\"227\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050140/description_98962afc-397c-461a-9a2d-3922c73a3b67.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"227\" height=\"227\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050140/description_64742ce3-c070-49e8-b573-3ae4814c9559.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"227\" height=\"227\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Create 模组与工程</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create (机械动力)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-aeronautics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Aeronautics (航空)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-big-cannons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Big Cannons (巨型火炮)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-steam-n-rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Steam &amp; Rails (蒸汽时代)</a><br>建造工厂、载具、飞艇以及强大的火炮系统</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>世界生成与探索</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty (百种生物群系)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structory (结构)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-cities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Lost Cities (失落之城)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towns-and-towers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towns and Towers (城镇与塔楼)</a><br>通过多样的地貌和被遗弃的城市环境增强探索体验<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050140/description_154df2fb-4f28-4db3-ace2-31316ec38d85.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"394\"><br><br><hr></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>装饰与建筑</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-deco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Deco (机械装饰)</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries (补充包)</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong>还有更多内容...</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>为什么选择游玩 Take A Look GUNS Remastered？</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>完全基于上一版本重构</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>专注于枪械、战争与工程学</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>使用现代武器和火炮进行大规模战斗</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>飞艇与先进的 Create 模组驱动机械</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>增强的探索与世界生成功能</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>非常适合单人及多人游戏</p>\n</li>\n<li><hr></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">由 _Stijn07 制作</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">欢迎来到 Take A Look GUNS 的下一代。<br>准备投入战争</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540stijnonark%253fis_from_webapp%253d1%2526sender_device%253dpc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TikTok</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/_stijn07/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252f_Stijn07\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></p>",
